---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy — IFFTU" description="How IFFTU handles data on ifftu.dev. Short version: we don't collect anything that identifies you." canonicalPath="/privacy/">
  <section class="page-header" data-watermark="P">
    <div class="page-header__inner container">
      <div class="page-header__pre text-mono animate-reveal delay-1">
        <span style="color: var(--accent);">//</span> DATA POLICY
      </div>
      <h1 class="page-header__title text-display animate-reveal delay-2">
        PRIVACY
      </h1>
      <p class="page-header__desc animate-reveal delay-3">
        Short version: we don't track you.<br class="hide-mobile" />
        Long version: read on.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="privacy">
    <div class="privacy__inner container">
      <div class="privacy__block animate-reveal delay-3">
        <h2 class="privacy__heading text-display">01 / WHAT WE COLLECT</h2>
        <p>
          This site uses <a href="https://plausible.io/privacy-focused-web-analytics" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Plausible Analytics</a>,
          a privacy-friendly, cookieless tool. We collect aggregate pageview counts, referrer URLs,
          country (from your IP, then discarded), browser name, and OS name.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="privacy__block animate-reveal delay-4">
        <h2 class="privacy__heading text-display">02 / WHAT WE DON'T COLLECT</h2>
        <ul class="privacy__list">
          <li>No cookies.</li>
          <li>No personal identifiers.</li>
          <li>No cross-site tracking.</li>
          <li>No fingerprinting.</li>
          <li>No data sold or shared with third parties.</li>
          <li>No profile of you, anywhere.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="privacy__block animate-reveal delay-4">
        <h2 class="privacy__heading text-display">03 / WHY WE COLLECT ANYTHING</h2>
        <p>
          We want to know which posts get read and which pages people land on,
          so we can spend our time writing about what's useful. That's all.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="privacy__block animate-reveal delay-4">
        <h2 class="privacy__heading text-display">04 / THIRD PARTIES</h2>
        <p>
          Plausible hosts analytics for us in the EU. Their
          <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">data policy</a>
          explains exactly what they do and don't store. We don't use Google Analytics,
          Facebook Pixel, or any other profile-building tool.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="privacy__block animate-reveal delay-4">
        <h2 class="privacy__heading text-display">05 / CONTACT</h2>
        <p>
          Questions or requests about data? Email
          <a href="mailto:admin@ifftu.dev" class="plausible-event-name=Contact-Click">admin@ifftu.dev</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .privacy {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }

  .privacy__inner {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .privacy__block {
    padding: var(--space-lg) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .privacy__block:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .privacy__heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .privacy p,
  .privacy__list {
    color: var(--gray-light);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .privacy__list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .privacy__list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .privacy__list li::before {
    content: '//';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }

  .privacy a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .privacy a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
